{"name":"Festival","hex":"#eacc4a","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"festival","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Pertaining to a feast or feast day; festive."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A feast or feast day, now especially a special event or series of events celebrating such occasions.","An event or series of special events centred on the celebration or promotion of some theme or aspect of the community, often held at regular intervals."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/festival"}],"entries":[{"title":"Festival","blocks":[{"text":"A festival is an event celebrated by a community and centred on one or more characteristic aspects of its religion, traditions or cultures. It is often observed as an indigenous or national holiday, a religious celebration, or a cultural fair (mela). A festival is a typical case of glocalization, and also reflects the high culture-low culture interrelationship. In addition to religion and folklore, a significant source for festivals has been agriculture. Since, food is such an essential resource, many festivals are associated with harvest time. Religious observances and thanksgiving for good harvests are integrated into celebrations that take place in autumn, such as Halloween in the northern hemisphere and Easter in the southern hemisphere."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6a/Holi_Festival_of_Colors_Utah%2C_United_States_2013.jpg/330px-Holi_Festival_of_Colors_Utah%2C_United_States_2013.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Festival","wikidata":"Q132241"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5e/Weezer_Bethlehem_2019_5.jpg/500px-Weezer_Bethlehem_2019_5.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5e/Weezer_Bethlehem_2019_5.jpg/1280px-Weezer_Bethlehem_2019_5.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5e/Weezer_Bethlehem_2019_5.jpg/500px-Weezer_Bethlehem_2019_5.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Musikfest, an eleven-day outdoor music festival held annually each August in Bethlehem, Pennsylvania, is the largest free music festival in the United States, drawing over 1.3 million attendees.[1]","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AWeezer_Bethlehem_2019_5.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/61/Red_and_Gold_for_Ni%C3%B1o.jpg/500px-Red_and_Gold_for_Ni%C3%B1o.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/61/Red_and_Gold_for_Ni%C3%B1o.jpg/1280px-Red_and_Gold_for_Ni%C3%B1o.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/61/Red_and_Gold_for_Ni%C3%B1o.jpg/500px-Red_and_Gold_for_Ni%C3%B1o.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Sinulog Festival is the one entitled of the “Grandest Festival of the Philippines” and which estimated over 4 million attendees. ","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ARed_and_Gold_for_Ni%C3%B1o.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8e/Peace_Revolution_first_program_ever.jpg/500px-Peace_Revolution_first_program_ever.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8e/Peace_Revolution_first_program_ever.jpg/1280px-Peace_Revolution_first_program_ever.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8e/Peace_Revolution_first_program_ever.jpg/500px-Peace_Revolution_first_program_ever.jpg?utm_source=en.